# Generated in the web image from the api image's OpenAPI document; a local copy must never leak in.
web/src/app/api
# The cut icon font: the web image generates its own before building, so a stale local copy must not leak in.
web/src/generated
# A machine's own values and keys stay on that machine: `composer dump-env prod` would compile a local .env into the
# image, and a host-side dump would shadow the build's own.
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/.env.local.php
**/config/secrets/*/*.decrypt.private.php
